{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Is this not that in which my lord drinks, etc.</b> How did it enter their minds to steal it — do you not know that the goblet in which my lord drinks he needs at all times and it is precious to him, and immediately when he does not find it he will divine, he himself — for he knows how to divine — or he will command others regarding it, to know who stole it?"], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:02.192602778Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}